The documentation prose in this repository — README.md, PLAN.md,
DECISIONS.md, WORKLOG.md, the research/ directory, the governance files, and
the generated site under docs/ — is licensed CC BY 4.0. Use it, quote it,
adapt it; credit DOE-MCP.

Two neighbours in this repository carry different terms and the difference is
deliberate:

  ../LICENSE          Apache-2.0, for code (src/, tools/, tests/)
  ../sources/LICENSE  CC0-1.0, for the source registry

The registry is CC0 rather than CC BY because attribution should not stand
between anyone and an inventory of what public data exists. The prose is CC BY
because it is argument and analysis, and argument travels better with its
source attached.

Content retrieved FROM the systems described here carries its own publisher's
terms; see ../THIRD_PARTY_DATA.yml.
